  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10257 GEF SGP 8th Operational Phase (Part 1) Trinidad &amp; Tobago</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Eighth Operational Phase of the Small Grants Programme (SGP OP8) is to engage local CSOs/CBOs in landscape-seascape approaches in Trinidad &amp; Tobago, providing them access to knowledge and information, capacitating them through learning-by-doing, skills development, and delivering technical and grant assistance for interventions that enhance wellbeing and socioeconomic conditions and generate environmental benefits. The SGP OP8 objectives reflect the key features of GEF Smal</narrative>
  </description>
